00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:33.190
I go to a little ramen place once a week in K-10.

631
00:24:33.470 --> 00:24:33.790
Don't say that.

632
00:24:35.130 --> 00:24:41.350
But I'm actually doing some charity work for Phil Abundance, which is the biggest food bank

633
00:24:41.350 --> 00:24:41.930
in Philadelphia.

634
00:24:42.230 --> 00:24:43.110
That's my hometown.

635
00:24:43.550 --> 00:24:47.410
I'm working with WMMR, which is their – the big radio station.

636
00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:50.230
They always have the big morning show with Preston and Steve.

637
00:24:50.350 --> 00:24:51.550
And I've been doing their show for years.

638
00:24:51.910 --> 00:24:54.470
And it's literally like five minutes from my dad's house.

639
00:24:54.570 --> 00:24:55.690
Like, I will roll out of bed.

640
00:24:55.770 --> 00:25:00.690
And if I'm in town, I just – and I occasionally sometimes let a four-letter word slip.

641
00:25:00.810 --> 00:25:05.150
So they literally have a button on their panel that says, the Flannery button, because

642
00:25:05.150 --> 00:25:06.690
there's a four-second, you know, five-second rule.

643
00:25:06.870 --> 00:25:07.690
Like, oh, they had – oh, whatever.

644
00:25:08.090 --> 00:25:10.110
Those FCC – gosh, it's crazy.

645
00:25:10.230 --> 00:25:12.650
But anyway, I love these guys so much.

646
00:25:12.710 --> 00:25:13.950
And they're making such a difference.

647
00:25:14.170 --> 00:25:16.610
Phil Abundance is – they're doing a huge push.

648
00:25:16.610 --> 00:25:18.010
They always do it right before Thanksgiving.

649
00:25:18.010 --> 00:25:23.590
But this year is even bigger because of the pandemic and because so many families are

650
00:25:23.590 --> 00:25:27.090
in need and there's so many businesses that are not happening and that we have to wait

651
00:25:27.090 --> 00:25:28.790
until we can all be together again.

652
00:25:28.950 --> 00:25:30.150
And we will be together again.

653
00:25:30.370 --> 00:25:35.070
But in the meantime, you know, you guys can go to philabundance.org and I'm going to

654
00:25:35.070 --> 00:25:39.190
be doing some – a little bit of press for them and I'll be –

655
00:25:39.190 --> 00:25:40.590
Kate, that is so great.

656
00:25:40.590 --> 00:25:43.970
And we should have mentioned that you are from Pennsylvania.

657
00:25:44.290 --> 00:25:44.550
Yes.

