660
00:25:49.690 --> 00:25:50.410
Flannery's Tavern.

661
00:25:50.570 --> 00:25:52.490
He was up all night trying to figure out a name.

662
00:25:52.610 --> 00:25:53.010
No, I'm just kidding.

