00:25:53.610 --> 00:25:55.210
My grandfather came up with the name too.

664
00:25:56.170 --> 00:26:01.090
Well, Kate, we love that you are giving back to Philly like that and we'll definitely,

665
00:26:01.870 --> 00:26:04.470
you know, we'll put in our socials where people can find that.

666
00:26:04.470 --> 00:26:05.130
That would be awesome.

667
00:26:05.310 --> 00:26:06.050
Thank you so much.

668
00:26:06.170 --> 00:26:07.250
You guys, I love you.

669
00:26:07.490 --> 00:26:08.370
So good to see you.

670
00:26:08.410 --> 00:26:08.490
Love you too.

671
00:26:08.610 --> 00:26:09.870
Thank you so much, Kate.

672
00:26:09.950 --> 00:26:10.750
This was amazing.

673
00:26:22.480 --> 00:26:23.180
We are back.

