678
00:26:37.580 --> 00:26:38.840
Not Kate Flannery.

679
00:26:39.160 --> 00:26:39.680
No.

680
00:26:40.060 --> 00:26:41.320
She looked amazing.

681
00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:44.140
And Kate, that was so fun and we can't thank you enough.

