00:27:03.940 --> 00:27:05.740
Oh, I'm kind of scared.

691
00:27:06.140 --> 00:27:07.140
Don't be scared.

692
00:27:07.280 --> 00:27:09.740
Although I could burn it to the ground, but so could you.

693
00:27:10.260 --> 00:27:10.600
Oh, dear.

