Okay, on July 31st, 2007, the whole cast got an email from Kent Zabornak.

695
00:27:20.120 --> 00:27:26.080
That said, hey all, for this Friday, August 3rd, here's our schedule for the day.

696
00:27:26.320 --> 00:27:27.860
8.45 a.m.

697
00:27:28.280 --> 00:27:32.280
Check in with the NBC Universal Studios Harassment Seminar.

698
00:27:32.460 --> 00:27:34.800
This will be located on Stage 3.

699
00:27:35.260 --> 00:27:36.300
9 a.m.

700
00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:37.780
Harassment Seminar.

701
00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:39.480
Mandatory attendance.

702
00:27:39.480 --> 00:27:40.780
10 a.m.

703
00:27:41.200 --> 00:27:42.160
Costume fittings.

704
00:27:42.420 --> 00:27:43.100
Wardrobe trailer.

705
00:27:43.560 --> 00:27:44.460
11 a.m.

706
00:27:44.820 --> 00:27:46.140
Table read episode.

707
00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:47.440
Fun run.

708
00:27:47.940 --> 00:27:49.000
In the writer's trailer.

709
00:27:49.700 --> 00:27:50.140
Noon.

710
00:27:50.500 --> 00:27:51.560
Cast physicals.

711
00:27:52.500 --> 00:27:54.140
Is that the end of the email?

712
00:27:55.000 --> 00:27:56.960
Please call if you have any questions, Kent.

713
00:27:57.500 --> 00:27:57.880
Oh.

714
00:27:58.600 --> 00:27:59.260
That's it?

715
00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:00.300
That's it.

716
00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:04.500
I thought it was, first of all, I thought this was an interesting perspective that

717
00:28:04.500 --> 00:28:07.340
