00:28:13.640 --> 00:28:19.620
I guess I just wasn't expecting the answer to be, you attended a harassment seminar and

721
00:28:19.620 --> 00:28:20.320
got a physical.

722
00:28:20.760 --> 00:28:23.400
I mean, I just thought like, what was I doing?

723
00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:24.680
I can't wait to find out.

724
00:28:24.680 --> 00:28:30.760
I mean, I have to say, I wouldn't pick this day to redo if a genie in a bottle ever gave

725
00:28:30.760 --> 00:28:31.460
me a wish.

726
00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:32.640
Okay.

727
00:28:32.760 --> 00:28:33.000
Okay.

728
00:28:33.220 --> 00:28:35.500
Well, I just thought this was a very interesting perspective.

729
00:28:35.500 --> 00:28:44.420
A, it shows what we had to do to start a new season and also B, we filmed Fun Run Part 1 and Part 2 in

730
00:28:44.420 --> 00:28:44.840
AuguSt.

731
00:28:45.340 --> 00:28:45.860
Okay.

