00:28:45.940 --> 00:28:52.640
This part of the episode, we're inside, but folks, we're going to be running outside.

733
00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:53.600
It's AuguSt.

734
00:28:53.600 --> 00:28:56.820
I just, I just think, I just think it's interesting perspective, Jenna.

