00:29:20.340 --> 00:29:21.140
You're going to want to.

747
00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:22.260
You shut it.

748
00:29:22.420 --> 00:29:23.180
You should scrapbook that.

749
00:29:23.300 --> 00:29:24.380
You shut it.

