1202
00:50:54.590 --> 00:50:59.290
You had a mandatory physical table read and a sexual harassment seminar.

1203
00:51:00.350 --> 00:51:00.830
Exactly.

1204
00:51:00.830 --> 00:51:03.890
Anyway, that's my little, that's my little tidbit.

1205
00:51:04.110 --> 00:51:10.410
Every time I see this scene, I'm reminded of the night that I first drank three margaritas.

1206
00:51:10.650 --> 00:51:12.330
Well, now I'll always remember it.

1207
00:51:12.550 --> 00:51:17.750
So, now Michael has to call Ryan, because Ryan is his boss, and tell him he hit Meredith

1208
