00:52:07.830 --> 00:52:09.130
Well, I guess I do know what it means.

1231
00:52:09.250 --> 00:52:10.730
He's, oh, it's so cringy.

1232
00:52:11.090 --> 00:52:12.070
Yeah, it's great.

