Remember, the people in the office, we don't know you're dating, right?

1236
00:52:29.270 --> 00:52:32.810
So you guys are still kind of like a secret couple.

1237
00:52:32.950 --> 00:52:38.030
Whenever you want to talk to each other, you have to go be, like, weirdly secretive about it.

1238
00:52:38.150 --> 00:52:38.490
Yeah.

1239
00:52:38.490 --> 00:52:40.790
I mean, I guess only Jim knows, right?

1240
00:52:41.850 --> 00:52:42.650
And Pam.

1241
00:52:42.810 --> 00:52:43.210
And Pam.

1242
00:52:43.470 --> 00:52:46.210
Have Jim and Pam hopefully talked about it at this point?

1243
00:52:46.210 --> 00:52:47.330
We still don't know.

1244
00:52:47.470 --> 00:52:48.130
You would think.

